<title>USA: Colombia tenders 4 crude cargoes for June loading.</title>
<headline>Colombia tenders 4 crude cargoes for June loading.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's state oil company Ecopetrol is tendering to sell four crude cargoes in June, trade sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Two Cusiana cargoes are available for loading June 3-7 and June 5-9.</p>
<p>Cusiana has an API gravity of 36.3 degrees and 0.25 percent sulfur.</p>
<p>One Cano Limon is available for loading June 13-23.</p>
<p>Cano Limon has a gravity of 29.5 degrees and 0.47 percent sulfur.</p>
<p>Finally, one South Blend cargo is on offer for loading June 20-30.</p>
<p>South Blend has a gravity of 29-30 degrees and around 0.7 percent sulfur.</p>
<p>((--Patricia Garip-Bertuol NY Energy Desk - 212 859 1620))</p>
